<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch bonds back to square one as gains vanish.</title>
<headline>Dutch bonds back to square one as gains vanish.</headline>
<text>
<p>---------------------(Snapshot at 1020 GMT)---------------------</p>
<p>  Feb  2002		   115.17/17 (-0.01)	   4.51 (UNCHD)</p>
<p>  Feb  2007 5.75 pct	101.82/90 (-0.01)	   5.50 (UNCHD)</p>
<p>* BUND FUTURE (Sept)	102.43 (+0.01)</p>
<p>--------------------------(SPREADS)----------------------------</p>
